  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In army fights, defense walls raised by earth path Gu can be returned to flat grassland under this Gu, which is why Hei Lou Lan says defense lines are useless once Tai Bai Yun Sheng assists. Gu Guo Long’s piled stone mountain had stood on land that was originally flat grassland, so the Gu returns that ground to that earlier state.",
        "chapters": [
          524
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_hei_lou_lan",
          "char_gu_guo_long"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "feeding": {
    "known": false,
    "food_raw": null,
    "foods": [],
    "claims": []
  },
  "refinement": {
    "recipes": [],
    "used_in_recipes": [],
    "refinement_materials": [],
    "confirmed_evolutions": [],
    "related_variants": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When Ma Shang Feng tries to hold a defense line after Ma tribe flees, Tai Bai Yun Sheng’s mountain as before Gu wrecks that line so Hei tribe can break through.",
        "chapters": [
          543
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "landscape-as-before-material",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_ma_shang_feng",
          "fac_ma_tribe"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan later treats river as before and mountain as before as the main materials Tai Bai Yun Sheng will use to create Immortal Gu Landscape As Before after becoming a Gu Immortal, and weighs plans that include plundering both Gu or losing them to self-destruction.",
        "chapters": [
          544
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "landscape-as-before-material",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "move_landscape_as_before",
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Vague rumors in Fang Yuan’s prior life say the two rank five Gu can merge into rank six Landscape As Before when Dao marks attract during immortal ascension.",
        "chapters": [
          544
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "landscape-as-before-material",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_dao_marks"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The core of Tai Bai Yun Sheng’s time path Immortal inheritance names three Gu: river as before Gu, mountain as before Gu, and man as before Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          604
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "landscape-as-before-material",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_man_as_before_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "During his immortal ascension he sends River As Before and Mountain As Before into the forming immortal aperture to stabilize it, then both sit under qi cocoons with man as before and other Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          609
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "landscape-as-before-material",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Landscape As Before then forms by combining River as Before and Mountain as Before, and Tai Bai Yun Sheng reads its effect as their product elevated.",
        "chapters": [
          611
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "landscape-as-before-material",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
